<TITLE>Environmental Considerations</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Recyclability has been improved by adopting Toyota Super Olefin Polymer (TSOP), a highly recyclable material, and PVC-free material (TPO) for the roof mouldings, belt mouldings, etc. In addition, the silicone applied to the door weatherstrips has been changed from an organic material to an inorganic material in consideration of the environment.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
